egration:** Can connect to VS Code for native diffing and workspace-aware assistance.[5]\n\n### **Getting Started**\nYou can install Gemini CLI using several package managers:\n*   **npm:** `npm install -g @google/gemini-cli`[2][9]\n*   **Homebrew:** `brew install gemini-cli`[2]\n*   **npx (Run without install):** `npx @google/gemini-cli`[2]\n\n### **Common Commands**\n*   `/help`: Display a list of available commands and tools.\n*   `/model`: Switch between different Gemini models (e.g., Gemini 2.5 Pro, Gemini 3 Flash).\n*   `/stats`: Check your current token usage and quota.[9]\n*   `/init`: Generate a starting `GEMINI.md` file for your project.[5]\n*   `/memory`: Manage persistent information the agent should remember.[8]\n\n### **Documentation Resources**\n*   **Official Docs:** [geminicli.com/docs](https://geminicli.com/docs/)[10]\n*   **GitHub Repository:** [google-gemini/gemini-cli](https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli)\n*   **Google Cloud Documentation:** [Gemini CLI Overview](https://cloud.google.com/gemini/docs/codeassist/gemini-cli)\n\nFor specific questions about how to use me (this instance of Gemini CLI), you can also use the `cli_help` sub-agent or ask about specific features like \"Plan mode\" or \"Agent skills.\"\n\nSources:\n[1] google.com (https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG5SRXwcNK-O25Ylg6gtcxcRoGcpiLuRpOr6w_IcO3SlpHrCeQp8808yyHzlEfiKs17n6jBP5pFmLCiq246hssPEOwF0RXEc3KzPPvY1qBMq__JBw5wzmW2Kr7MSlOTpwSKzfTZcU47EWxUpd3XK1ERnj-mtvy_ccA9AKE=)\n[2] github.com (https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHrRoTeCLS2-w-l3q4m5IxG5e81joUdhwRdTgXv5ysnNgrsECj8nD0jAArn0kYxb_fvB4NVplqAB5mYPuyB-94lYO32ZhNgP2xd7LgvIOx6MYXkQNtl9Ejt9gm9CQxwRiq0MCnFHc4=)\n[3] datacamp.com (https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEEuxsPOwNVA5xIpMrUxKL2kvcZ7hkjoJ1nsBuADvZJ-6aA0vhwavLqjUTHhPrtnEDokNlBSZyNJpFLg0yj0MDVahw1L_MlDgHD4xJopGztw--VHp4YJ4x0pYNqOjubqm6TLYaBGbSo)\n[4] blog.google (https